    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "83f39795-b499-42d8-9d0c-552746c01013",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* Barcelona hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Barcelona\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Spain\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "3db8afa1-51fd-4d1a-a21d-553759fc7df0",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on bed and breakfast basis at the 4* Pere IV Hotel. Located just three Metro stops from Barcelona city centre, facilities include a restaurant and a spa and all rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "1d948c7e-f207-48b4-b14b-bcf3fc03d915",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Barcelona\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEixample Quarter\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EParc Guell\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELa Sagrada Familia\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseu Nacional d\u0026#39;Art de Catalunya\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFigueres\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseo Teatro - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGirona\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECasa Mil\u00E0\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECasa Batll\u00F3\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFundaci\u00F3 Joan Mir\u00F3 - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAbbey Montserrat\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "853dec31-42cc-4206-b980-1a4afa583c67",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalau de la M\u00FAsica Catalana - built between 1905 and 1908 by the architect Lluis Dom\u00E8nech i Montaner and now designated a UNESCO World Heritage Site, this icon of Art Nouveau combines sculpture, mosaics, stained glass and wrought iron\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseu Picasso - the collection, which includes more than 3,500 works, is strongest on Picasso\u2019s earliest years, up until 1904, which is apt considering that the artist spent his formative creative years in Barcelona\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELas Ramblas - a vibrant avenue with wonderful flower stalls, performers, cafes and shops, the Liceu Opera House and the huge Boqueria food market amid wonderful modernist architecture\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "07818f26-1202-4d2a-9246-c8331d012c64",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Barcelona\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Barcelona from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our tour manager in our private executive coach to the 4* Pere IV Hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Barcelona guided tour, Eixample Quarter, Parc G\u00FCell, La Sagrada Familia \u0026amp; Museu Nacional d\u0026#39;Art de Catalunya\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided coach tour of Barcelona \u2013 the elegant Eixample Quarter of Barcelona is full of highly original buildings in the style of art and architecture known in Catalonia as Modernisme \u2013 Gaud\u00ED\u2019s Parc G\u00FCell, commissioned by Eusebi G\u00FCell who wanted to create a stylish park for Barcelona aristocracy, was built between 1910 and 1914 and is now a designated UNESCO World Heritage Site and one of the most popular visitor attractions of the city \u2013 travel on to the church of La Sagrada Familia, Gaud\u00ED\u2019s great unfinished masterpiece \u2013 the collection of Catalan art at Museu Nacional d\u0026#39;Art de Catalunya (MNAC) ranges from the 11th century Romanesque through the Gothic era to modern art with works by artists such as El Greco, Zurbar\u00E1n, Vel\u00E1zquez, Gaud\u00ED, Dal\u00ED and Picasso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Figueres, Museo Teatro \u0026amp; Girona\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFigueres is the home town of Salvador Dal\u00ED \u2013 a guided tour of the Museo Teatro, founded in 1974 and now the most visited museum in Spain, which houses not only works by the great artist but is also the site of Dal\u00ED\u2019s mausoleum \u2013 en route back to Barcelona we visit Girona, one of Catalonia\u2019s most important cities, with its dominant cathedral and ancient medieval streets.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Casa Mil\u00E0, Casa Batll\u00F3 \u0026amp; Fundaci\u00F3 Joan Mir\u00F3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVisit Gaud\u00ED\u2019s Casa Mil\u00E0 (or \u2018La Pedrera\u2019), the apartment block built between 1906 and 1910 and ridiculed by Barcelona\u2019s intellectuals for its complete departure from the established construction principles of the time \u2013 the extraordinary Casa Batll\u00F3 on the prestigious Passeig de Gr\u00E0cia was designed by Gaud\u00ED for Josep Batll\u00F3, a wealthy aristocrat, and is now designated a UNESCO World Heritage Site \u2013 a guided tour of the Fundaci\u00F3 Joan Mir\u00F3 explores the permanent collection of graphics, paintings and statues by the surrealist artist Joan Mir\u00F3.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Abbey Montserrat\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEnjoy a beautiful drive to Montserrat\u0026#39;s Benedictine monastery clinging to craggy mountains that rise to over 1,000 metres with dramatic views over Catalonia \u2013 transfer to the airport for our scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
